  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-03-29T01:18:54.522Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At random worlds will just lock up. They won't freeze, instead i'll just be locked up and my character will face completely forward no matter where i look. I can move my head a little bit before the camera snaps forward. When this happens i can't access any menus or do anything. On top of that i can hear all the sound sources in the room regardless of where i am (for example i could be on the top floor of the pug but when it happens i can hear the phone and the fire all at once)\n\nThis is really annoying because not only does it make me feel downright ill when it happens (due to the extreme motion sickness it gives me) but also because it happens so frequently. This only ever seems to happen in VR too, so far this hasn't happened to me on desktop.",
